OL,3,AReform defector reveals she voted
OL,4,ARemain in Brexit vote and wants Welsh
OL,5,Aindependence
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Member of the Senedd who quit Reform
OL,8,Fto join Plaid Cymru says she would back
OL,9,FWelsh independence if a vote were held
OL,10,Fand has revealed she voted Remain in
OL,11,Fthe 2016 Brexit referendum.
OL,13,FSarah Cooper-Lesadd, one of 34 Reform
OL,14,FMSs elected in May's Senedd election,
OL,15,Fdefected to Plaid on Tuesday.
OL,17,FShe told BBC's Walescast that her
OL,18,Fformer party was "completely chaotic"
OL,19,Fand was "falling apart at the seams".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
